God Almighty, God Almighty, God Almighty,
shall on Zion strength bestow.

O God, to us show mercy and bless us in your grace;
cause now to shine upon us the brightness of your face;
that so your way most holy on earth may soon be known,
and unto ev'ry people your saving grace be shown.

O God, let all men praise you, let all the nations sing;
